  (text "Pip v4 safety board, netlist v4 (rnd/electrical.py -> docs/rnd/electrical.md *Safety board*).\nGenerated by `python -m rnd.kicad_board`; the drawing cannot drift from the analysed netlist:\nrnd/kicad_check.py compares the exported netlist with the model and with electrical.py's table.\nFields on every symbol: Origin (netlist v4 / added: why), NetlistRef (the electrical.py ref it implements),\nLocation (board / chassis), Variant (all / robot / M1), Basis (where the value comes from).\nReview: docs/rnd/safety_board_kicad.md and the G-SB checklist in docs/rnd/safety_board_tests.md." (at 30 150 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d22a5344-e2b4-5be9-a6a2-5f1aa021f249"))
